        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Large Doorbell Button Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Large Doorbell Button Plate is made of solid brass. Large rectangular plate made to fit a standard in wall electrical box. A rectangular plate, it measures 4-1/2 inches high by 2-3/4 inches wide with a 3-5/16 inch center to center. Available 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the BBC20CPC4764 Large Door Bell Button:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers (distance between the 2 mounting screws): 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes replacement bell button and matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BBC20CPC4764.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>BBC20CPC4764 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
